{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00023",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.88,
      "end_seconds": 3.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Hello, please sit down. Have you been waiting long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.24,
      "end_seconds": 7.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Only about ten minutes, no trouble."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.23,
      "end_seconds": 10.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "So, what's been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.67,
      "end_seconds": 22.87,
      "duration_seconds": 12.2,
      "text": "Well, uh, I've been having pain in my left wrist after a fall. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.42,
      "end_seconds": 28.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "How long has this been going on? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.98,
      "end_seconds": 32.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "It's been one week, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.56,
      "end_seconds": 40.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "Go on. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.01,
      "end_seconds": 57.29,
      "duration_seconds": 16.28,
      "text": "It happens on and off. Only holding it still, and it's not much. Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I've also had tingling in the fingers, for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.26,
      "end_seconds": 65.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any pain in the elbow or deformity?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.05,
      "end_seconds": 69.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "No, no pain in the elbow or deformity."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.84,
      "end_seconds": 73.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.52,
      "end_seconds": 75.25,
      "duration_seconds": 0.73,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.46,
      "end_seconds": 91.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.92,
      "end_seconds": 99.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "I take alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week. I'm on paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.94,
      "end_seconds": 104.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Go on. Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.4,
      "end_seconds": 120.74,
      "duration_seconds": 13.34,
      "text": "Um, for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.76,
      "end_seconds": 126.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.37,
      "end_seconds": 132.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "So, no, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.7,
      "end_seconds": 136.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.13,
      "end_seconds": 138.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Yes, thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.02,
      "end_seconds": 142.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.69,
      "end_seconds": 144.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.09,
      "end_seconds": 157.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.07,
      "end_seconds": 166.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.48,
      "text": "Um, yes, I had my gallbladder removed, in 2016. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.41,
      "end_seconds": 171.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.39,
      "end_seconds": 175.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Yeah, thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.02,
      "end_seconds": 180.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.52,
      "end_seconds": 182.22,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.95,
      "end_seconds": 186.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Alright, I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.86,
      "end_seconds": 209.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "There's swelling and tenderness at the base of the thumb side of the wrist."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.17,
      "end_seconds": 238.41,
      "duration_seconds": 25.24,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with a wrist sprain, but a small fracture is possible at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.72,
      "end_seconds": 241.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Is it something serious, um, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.11,
      "end_seconds": 260.55,
      "duration_seconds": 18.44,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a wrist sprain, but a small fracture is possible is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in your left wrist after a fall for one week, mild, and no pain in the elbow or deformity."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.58,
      "end_seconds": 266.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.51,
      "end_seconds": 269.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.29,
      "end_seconds": 273.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.26,
      "end_seconds": 282.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "Let's get an X-ray of the wrist, for wrist injury. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.85,
      "end_seconds": 284.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.85,
      "end_seconds": 307.54,
      "duration_seconds": 21.69,
      "text": "I'd like you to wear a splint until the X-ray result is confirmed and keep the hand raised. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. We'll refer you to the orthopaedic clinic. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.28,
      "end_seconds": 311.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Got it, um, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.59,
      "end_seconds": 315.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the X-ray."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.57,
      "end_seconds": 319.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.13,
      "end_seconds": 324.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.53,
      "end_seconds": 329.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "So, I come back after the X-ray. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.07,
      "end_seconds": 334.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.45,
      "end_seconds": 338.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "That's all, thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.15,
      "end_seconds": 340.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Right, take care."
    }
  ]
}